WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:07.060
Hello again! Let's have a chat. You can ask me anything about your dealership, in plain English.

2
00:00:08.171 --> 00:00:15.691
Type your question, or press the microphone and just say it. I look at your own stock, leads, bookings and jobs.

3
00:00:19.294 --> 00:00:24.384
You get a straight answer, about your own cars, and I always tell you how sure I am.

4
00:00:32.679 --> 00:00:38.769
In a hurry? Morning Briefing, Today's Priorities and your review are just one tap away.

5
00:00:39.884 --> 00:00:44.294
Ask me anything, any time. I don't even need a cup of tea.
